+{\bm{v}}_{t}{\bm{k}}_{t}^{\!\top},\;{\bm{o}}_{t}={\mathbf{S}}_{t}{\bm{q}}_{t}.</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1d">bold_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT = bold_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t - 1 end_POSTSUBSCRIPT ⊙ ( bold_1 bold_italic_α start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT ⊤ end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT ) + bold_italic_v start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT bold_italic_k start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT ⊤ end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT , bold_italic_o start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT = bold_S start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT bold_italic_q start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT .</annotation></semantics></math>
The form of the decay distinguishes three representative models.
<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.1">(i) HGRN-2</span> ties the gate across keys and values, i.e. <math alttext="{\bm{\alpha}}_{t}=\alpha_{t}\mathbf{1}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1"><semantics id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.cmml"><msub id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.2.cmml">𝜶</mi><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mrow id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml"><msub id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.2.cmml">α</mi><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.1.cmml">⁢</mo><mn id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.3.cmml">𝟏</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1b"><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1"><eq id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.1"></eq><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.2">𝜶</ci><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.2.3">𝑡</ci></apply><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3"><times id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.1"></times><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.2">𝛼</ci><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.2.3">𝑡</ci></apply><cn id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.3.cmml" type="integer" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1.1.3.3">1</cn></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1c">{\bm{\alpha}}_{t}=\alpha_{t}\mathbf{1}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.4.m4.1d">bold_italic_α start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT = italic_α start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT bold_1</annotation></semantics></math>,
yielding a hierarchical separation between slowly changing coarse memory and rapidly updated token detail <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2507.06457v1#bib.bib4" title="">4</a>]</cite>.
<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.2">(ii) GLA</span> lets <math alttext="{\bm{\alpha}}_{t}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1"><semantics id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1a"><msub id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.2.cmml">𝜶</mi><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1b"><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.2">𝜶</ci><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1.1.3">𝑡</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1c">{\bm{\alpha}}_{t}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.5.m5.1d">bold_italic_α start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> be fully data-dependent, learned per time-step and per channel, providing maximal flexibility but higher parameter cost <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2507.06457v1#bib.bib34" title="">34</a>]</cite>.
<span class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.3">(iii) RetNet</span> fixes <math alttext="{\bm{\alpha}}_{t}=\gamma" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1"><semantics id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1a"><mrow id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.cmml"><msub id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.2.cmml">𝜶</mi><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.3.cmml">γ</mi></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1b"><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1"><eq id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.1"></eq><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.2">𝜶</ci><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.2.3">𝑡</ci></apply><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1.1.3">𝛾</ci></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1c">{\bm{\alpha}}_{t}=\gamma</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.6.m6.1d">bold_italic_α start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT = italic_γ</annotation></semantics></math> with <math alttext="\gamma\in(0,1)" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2"><semantics id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2a"><mrow id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.cmml"><mi id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.2.cmml">γ</mi><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.1.cmml">∈</mo><mrow id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.1.cmml"><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.2.1" stretchy="false" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.1.cmml">(</mo><mn id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.1.1" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.1.1.cmml">0</mn><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.2.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.1.cmml">,</mo><mn id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.2" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.2.cmml">1</mn><mo id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.2.3" stretchy="false" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2b"><apply id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3"><in id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.1"></in><ci id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.2.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.2">𝛾</ci><interval closure="open" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.1.cmml" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.3.3.2"><cn id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.1.1.cmml" type="integer" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.1.1">0</cn><cn id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.2.cmml" type="integer" xref="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2.2">1</cn></interval></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2c">\gamma\in(0,1)</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p1.7.m7.2d">italic_γ ∈ ( 0 , 1 )</annotation></semantics></math> learned once and shared across positions, giving the simplest decay and the fastest inference but no content adaptivity <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2507.06457v1#bib.bib17" title="">17</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="ltx_paragraph" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px3">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Generation 3 – delta-rule controlled forgetting.</h4>
<div class="ltx_para" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1">
<p class="ltx_p" id="S3.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.4">The third generation abandons per-channel (diagonal) decay and instead applies a rank-1 dense transition that first erases any content aligned with the current key and then writes the new association:</p>
<table class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table" id="S3.Ex1">
<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math alttext="{\mathbf{S}}_{t}={\mathbf{S}}_{t-1}\bigl{(}\mathbf{I}-\beta_{t}{\bm{k}}_{t}{%
\bm{k}}_{t}^{\!\top}\bigr{)}+\beta_{t}{\bm{v}}_{t}{\bm{k}}_{t}^{\!\top},\qquad%
