<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span class="ltx_text" id="A1.T7.40.5.1" style="font-size:113%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span class="ltx_text" id="A1.T7.30.4" style="font-size:113%;">Per-token forward FLOP counts <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" id="A1.T7.30.4.1">summed over all heads</em>. Multiply by <math alttext="L" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1"><semantics id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1b"><mi id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1.1" xref="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1.1.cmml">L</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1c"><ci id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1.1">𝐿</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1d">L</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.T7.27.1.m1.1e">italic_L</annotation></semantics></math> to obtain the per-layer sequence cost. For HGRN-1 the mixer is single-head by design (<math alttext="H=1" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1"><semantics id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1b"><mrow id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">H</mi><mo id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mn id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml">1</mn></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1c"><apply id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1"><eq id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.1"></eq><ci id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.2">𝐻</ci><cn id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" type="integer" xref="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1.1.3">1</cn></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1d">H=1</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.T7.28.2.m2.1e">italic_H = 1</annotation></semantics></math>); all other models allow arbitrary <math alttext="H" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1"><semantics id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1b"><mi id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1.1" xref="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1.1.cmml">H</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1c"><ci id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1.1">𝐻</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1d">H</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.T7.29.3.m3.1e">italic_H</annotation></semantics></math>. Softmax attention is quadratic in <math alttext="L" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1"><semantics id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1b"><mi id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1.1" xref="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1.1.cmml">L</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1c"><ci id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1.1">𝐿</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1d">L</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.T7.30.4.m4.1e">italic_L</annotation></semantics></math>, whereas the linear/recurrent mixers are linear.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section class="ltx_paragraph" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Baseline: softmax self-attention</h4>
<div class="ltx_para" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1">
<p class="ltx_p" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3">The dot-product matrix <math alttext="QK^{\top}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml">Q</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">⁢</mo><msup id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml">K</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml">⊤</mo></msup></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1"><times id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.1"></times><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">𝑄</ci><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">superscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2">𝐾</ci><csymbol cd="latexml" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3">top</csymbol></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1c">QK^{\top}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.m1.1d">italic_Q italic_K start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT ⊤ end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> is strictly lower-triangular under causal masking. Forming and applying it costs <math alttext="(H\,L(L+1)d_{\mathrm{head}})" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.2" stretchy="false" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.cmml">(</mo><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.3.cmml">H</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2" lspace="0.170em" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">⁢</mo><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.4" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.4.cmml">L</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2a" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">⁢</mo><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" stretchy="false" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">(</mo><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">L</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">+</mo><mn id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml">1</mn></mrow><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" stretchy="false" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2b" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2.cmml">⁢</mo><msub id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.2.cmml">d</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.3.cmml">head</mi></msub></mrow><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.3" stretchy="false" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.cmml">)</mo></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"><times id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.2"></times><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.3">𝐻</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.4.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.4">𝐿</ci><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1"><plus id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1"></plus><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.2">𝐿</ci><cn id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.cmml" type="integer" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3">1</cn></apply><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.2">𝑑</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.1.5.3">head</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1c">(H\,L(L+1)d_{\mathrm{head}})</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.2.m2.1d">( italic_H italic_L ( italic_L + 1 ) italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT )</annotation></semantics></math> multiplies plus the same number of adds. Using <math alttext="d_{\mathrm{model}}=Hd_{\mathrm{head}}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1a"><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml"><msub id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2.cmml">d</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3.cmml">model</mi></msub><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml">=</mo><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.2.cmml">H</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.1.cmml">⁢</mo><msub id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.2.cmml">d</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.3.cmml">head</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1b"><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1"><eq id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.1"></eq><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.2">𝑑</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.2.3">model</ci></apply><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3"><times id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.1"></times><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.2">𝐻</ci><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.2">𝑑</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1.1.3.3.3">head</ci></apply></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1c">d_{\mathrm{model}}=Hd_{\mathrm{head}}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.3.m3.1d">italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_model end_POSTSUBSCRIPT = italic_H italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> gives</p>
<table class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table" id="A1.E1">
<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
