<p class="ltx_p" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.4">Importantly the head count cancels, so the quadratic term depends only on the model width.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="ltx_paragraph" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Vector-state mixers (classical / gated RNNs)</h4>
<div class="ltx_para" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1">
<p class="ltx_p" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3">A single hidden vector <math alttext="h_{t}\!\in\!\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{head}}}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1a"><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml"><msub id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.2.cmml">h</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.3.cmml">t</mi></msub><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.1" lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml">∈</mo><msup id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml">ℝ</mi><msub id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.2.cmml">d</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.3.cmml">head</mi></msub></msup></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1b"><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1"><in id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.1"></in><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.2">ℎ</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.2.3">𝑡</ci></apply><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3">superscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.2">ℝ</ci><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.2">𝑑</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1.1.3.3.3">head</ci></apply></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1c">h_{t}\!\in\!\mathbb{R}^{d_{\mathrm{head}}}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.1.m1.1d">italic_h start_POSTSUBSCRIPT italic_t end_POSTSUBSCRIPT ∈ blackboard_R start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> is maintained <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.1">per head</em>. Each head therefore needs <math alttext="5d_{\mathrm{head}}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mn id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">5</mn><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml">⁢</mo><msub id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.cmml">d</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3.cmml">head</mi></msub></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1"><times id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"></times><cn id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" type="integer" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.2">5</cn><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2">𝑑</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3">head</ci></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1c">5d_{\mathrm{head}}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.2.m2.1d">5 italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> FLOPs per token. Aggregating over <math alttext="H" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1a"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml">H</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1b"><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1.1">𝐻</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1c">H</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p1.3.m3.1d">italic_H</annotation></semantics></math> heads:</p>
