nd_POSTSUBSCRIPT ∈ blackboard_R start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT × italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math>.
If an update costs <math alttext="k\,d_{\mathrm{head}}^{2}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1a"><mrow id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml">k</mi><mo id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.1" lspace="0.170em" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml">⁢</mo><msubsup id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.2" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.2.cmml">d</mi><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.3.cmml">head</mi><mn id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3.cmml">2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1b"><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1"><times id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.1"></times><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.2">𝑘</ci><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3">superscript</csymbol><apply id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3"><csymbol cd="ambiguous" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3">subscript</csymbol><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.2.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.2">𝑑</ci><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.3.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.2.3">head</ci></apply><cn id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3.cmml" type="integer" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1.1.3.3">2</cn></apply></apply></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1c">k\,d_{\mathrm{head}}^{2}</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.2.m2.1d">italic_k italic_d start_POSTSUBSCRIPT roman_head end_POSTSUBSCRIPT start_POSTSUPERSCRIPT 2 end_POSTSUPERSCRIPT</annotation></semantics></math> FLOPs per head (where <math alttext="k" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1"><semantics id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1a"><mi id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1.1" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml">k</mi><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1b"><ci id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1.1.cmml" xref="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1.1">𝑘</ci></annotation-xml><annotation encoding="application/x-tex" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1c">k</annotation><annotation encoding="application/x-llamapun" id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.3.m3.1d">italic_k</annotation></semantics></math> is a constant that varies between different models), the layer total is:</p>
